# DS-8 probe, an IC Housing: what writing Mode to a gauge does (a gauge
# has none). One Gauge2x2 on the network. Expected: the chip stops at
# the sd line with an error, with r2 = 1 and r3 = 0.
# r0: the gauge's ReferenceId. r2: 1 just before the write. r3: 1 if
# the chip carried on past it.
move r2 0
move r3 0
main:
yield
lb r0 HASH("ModularDeviceGauge2x2") ReferenceId Sum
beqz r0 main
move r2 1
sd r0 Mode 3
move r3 1
j main
